        "Name": "Baker",
        "ID": "Baker",
        "Description": "Three-phase oil relative permeabilities are determined by a saturation-weighted interpolation between oil\u2013water and oil\u2013gas data based on (Baker, L. E.: \"Three-Phase Relative Permeability Correlations\", paper SPE 17369 presented at the SPE Enhanced Oil Recovery Symposium, Tulsa, Oklahoma, USA (16-21 April 1988)).",
