        "ID": "Stone2",
        "Description": "Model based on channel flow theory which uses of all four two-phase relative permeability relationships from the oil\u2013gas and oil\u2013water systems based on (Stone, H. L.: \"Estimation of Three-Phase Relative Permeability and Residual Oil Data\", Journal of Canadian Petroleum Technology (1973)). ",
