        "Description": "In this model, relative permeability to oil is obtained by true linear interpolation between two-phase relative permeability curves (oil-water and oil-gas) based on (Baker, L. E.: \"Three-Phase Relative Permeability Correlations\", paper SPE 17369 presented at the SPE Enhanced Oil Recovery Symposium, Tulsa, Oklahoma, USA (16-21 April 1988)).",
